{"identity_key": "x:2125611170891448606", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2125611170891448606", "title": null, "content": "Expelled from Paradise: The Stellar Angel is out\n\n\n\nA completely new story taking place after the first movie\n\n\n\nWritten by Teshirogi Shoutarou, who worked with nitro+ on the Expelled From Paradise: mission.0 light novel, Thunderbolt Fantasy Drama CDs, and Tokyo NECRO: SUICIDE MISSION\n\n\n\nAngela Balzac now lives on the surface. As she builds a life with her partner Dingo, a new case is brought to her door\n\n\n\nDeveloped by Studio51 and published by Toei Animation\n\n\n\nThe Stellar Angel is available in Japanese and English\n\n\n\nvndb: https://nitter.cf/t.co/HdJrnZrbjF\n\nSteam: https://nitter.cf/t.co/42et6I41wU", "publisher": "ErogeAreAlive", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/ErogeAreAlive/status/2125611170891448606", "published_at": "2026-11-25T15:22:49+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:22:49 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-25T15:31:01.493472+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "erogeAreAlive", "author_name": "Expelled from Paradise", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
